From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:02:14 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Meridian: AI subscriptions per space: accounts of Claude
 Code, Codex, Copilot CLI and Gemini CLI

Each account is a config folder of the CLI, set by its own variable
(CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR, CODEX_HOME, COPILOT_HOME, GEMINI_CLI_HOME). Folders are
found by file names only, never opened. A space chooses an account per CLI:
Ask, Workbench terminals and Context Insights use it. MCP: list_ai_accounts,
set_space_ai_account.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
